                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Guyya suni Waaqi goraade jabdu aka male qara qabduni goorjama Lewiathani jed'ani, ka bisaani keesati galu, ka ufi garagalche aka bofa lohu, gaargalcha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
